Package: drugsens
Title: Automated Analysis of 'QuPath' Output Data and Metadata Extraction
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for analyzing microscopy data output from 'QuPath' software. 
    Provides functionality for automated data processing, metadata extraction, control normalization,
    dose-response modeling, and statistical visualization of imaging results. The methodology
    implemented in this package is based on Labrosse et al. (2024) <doi:10.1016/j.xpro.2024.103274>
    "Protocol for quantifying drug sensitivity in 3D patient-derived ovarian cancer models",
    which describes the complete workflow for drug sensitivity analysis in patient-derived cancer models.
Version: 0.2.0
BugReports: https://github.com/flalom/drugsens/issues
SystemRequirements: QuPath (>= 0.4.0)
